let's dive into Backtracking! 🔥
Backtracking is basically DFS + decision making + undo. Jab brute force try karte ho saare possibilities, lekin jahan galat ho jaaye wahan wapas jaake (backtrack) dusra option try karte ho.
Core Idea (Simple Language mein)

Choose → ek decision lo (number place karo, character pick karo, etc.)
Explore → us decision ke saath aage badho (recursive call)
Unchoose (Backtrack) → agar yeh path galat nikla toh decision wapas le lo aur next option try karo

Yeh technique mostly constraints + constraints satisfy karne wale solutions dhoondne mein use hoti hai.

Classic Problems (Order mein sikhte hain)
We'll follow this flow:

Subsets / Power Set
Combinations (Combination Sum)
Permutations
N-Queens (most famous backtracking example)
Sudoku (optional if time ho)